  "classification_rules": [
    "A resource is the primary physical or chemical energy input.",
    "A carrier is an energy form produced from another source and used to transport or deliver energy.",
    "A conversion technology changes a resource or carrier into electricity, heat, motion, or another carrier.",
    "Storage time-shifts energy and must not be counted as a primary source.",
    "Capacity, generation, production, consumption, technical potential, and scenario output are different measures."
